  "caption": "Europe is not one property cycle.\n\nEurostat reports house prices up 17.8% in Portugal and down 2.0% in Finland in Q1 2026 versus Q1 2025. These are nominal transaction-price changes, not rental yields or absolute property prices.\n\nWhich market and asset would you study further before buying?\n\nSource: Eurostat: house price index, 2 July 2026.\nhttps://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/statistics-explained/index.php?title=Housing_price_statistics_-_house_price_index\n\n#Cyprus #CyprusProperty #RealEstate #Investment #TheSmartySolution",
